{
    "title": "X Launcher",
    "description": "X Launcher is a flat design, smooth and small launcher for your android phone. It uses flat design; It can completely change the appearance and operation of your phone, giving you an unprecedented experience. simple, elegant, modern!\r\n\r\nWith X Launcher, you will be able to customize your android phone to make it looks modern and cool.\r\n\r\n<b>Control Center</b>\r\nSwipe down to enter Control Center; Set WiFi, Network, Brightness, Volume, Take Photo quickly.\r\n\r\n<b>App Manager</b>\r\nSwipe up to open App Manager; Find local apps and drop them to desktop quickly.\r\n\r\n<b>Left Screen</b>\r\nWe provide left screen on the left of the desktop, some flat designed widgets on it, provide a convenient way to see time and weather, search apps, etc.\r\n\r\n<b>Theme Store</b>\r\nWe offer thousands of themes in theme store, Adaptive to the themes you select, which can bring you smooth interface.\r\n\r\n<b>Customize</b>\r\nThe icon and name of the app can be modified, You can choose a local image and then crop it, use it as an app icon.\r\nYou can change the number of rows and columns of the launcher.\r\n\r\n<b>Rounded Corners Folder</b>\r\nWe design a rounded corners folder, you can drop an app to another to create a folder.\r\n\r\n<b>Hide Apps</b>\r\nHide apps you don't want displayed in the launcher.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>We request Storage permission to save downloaded themes and wallpapers, to get the wallpaper currently used by the android system.</b>\r\n\r\n<b>Download X Launcher now and join us! More interesting features will coming soon!</b>",
    "descriptionHTML": "X Launcher is a flat design, smooth and small launcher for your android phone. It uses flat design; It can completely change the appearance and operation of your phone, giving you an unprecedented experience. simple, elegant, modern!<br><br>With X Launcher, you will be able to customize your android phone to make it looks modern and cool.<br><br><b>Control Center</b><br>Swipe down to enter Control Center; Set WiFi, Network, Brightness, Volume, Take Photo quickly.<br><br><b>App Manager</b><br>Swipe up to open App Manager; Find local apps and drop them to desktop quickly.<br><br><b>Left Screen</b><br>We provide left screen on the left of the desktop, some flat designed widgets on it, provide a convenient way to see time and weather, search apps, etc.<br><br><b>Theme Store</b><br>We offer thousands of themes in theme store, Adaptive to the themes you select, which can bring you smooth interface.<br><br><b>Customize</b><br>The icon and name of the app can be modified, You can choose a local image and then crop it, use it as an app icon.<br>You can change the number of rows and columns of the launcher.<br><br><b>Rounded Corners Folder</b><br>We design a rounded corners folder, you can drop an app to another to create a folder.<br><br><b>Hide Apps</b><br>Hide apps you don&#39;t want displayed in the launcher.<br><br><br><b>We request Storage permission to save downloaded themes and wallpapers, to get the wallpaper currently used by the android system.</b><br><br><b>Download X Launcher now and join us! More interesting features will coming soon!</b>",
